"tformat","target":"#PINK#%d 伤害链接#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"220ef5882285573c5a22a522cf6ba90165d2788fefbc3dd4d67248a250505cb1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"68d75eb59e26bacbdcf0dcfa1336f514e9f5b1375f8953f898414e71ec2a1914","logical_entry_identity":"c1113137b4b184806dc83a734cf37a26d4a0abbb29609d9ecd219bb7e382c0b5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Of course there was no Resonating Diamond. What makes you think Briagh would let one loose for even a second?","source_tag":"_t","target":"你当然找不到共鸣钻石，你想想布莱亚怎么可能让一颗钻石溜走？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b807512c6dcdaf804636ad22eb23d9804f720769ef0bc3a59dbfbfac6c98a0cf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"68e70cea1c722025c85fe946070152deb7e5b7b4eb659a0cc5134e808b21298b","logical_entry_identity":"98bfc8a1bcbff8ae7391cdf4910f6e5b794460ea78ff0eb306646c80b70fa673","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I have great news! Our glorious leader has written to me, telling me of his travels. He is on a great pilgrimage, a holy quest to discover more about the Spellblaze and its powers, so that we may show the truth about it to the world. It is a quest fraught with peril, for we have many enemies in the world. But by his powers he cannot fail. He cannot! He cannot...\n\nOne day soon he will return to us, and bring us to our proper glory. Look forward to that great time, when he is amongst us once more. Be ready for that moment when he stands tall before us and looks at us with his deep eyes... Work hard now and be attentive in your duties, so that we may make him proud. We fight for him, we struggle for him, and if needs be we will die for him. He is our hope and our glory, and the only joy we have in this dispassionate world.\n\n-- The Inquisitor\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"我有天大的好消息！我们荣耀的领袖来信了，告诉我他旅途中的见闻。他正进行一场伟大的朝圣，一项探寻魔法大爆炸及其力量的神圣使命，好让我们向世界揭示它的真相。这项使命危机四伏，因为我们在世上树敌众多。但凭他的力量，他绝不会失败。他不会！他不会……\n\n用不了多久，他便会回到我们身边，带领我们赢得应有的荣耀。期盼那伟大的日子吧，期盼他再度与我们同在。做好准备，迎接他挺立在我们面前、用那双深邃眼眸凝望我们的时刻……现在务必勤勉工作，专心尽责，好让他为我们骄傲。我们为他战斗，为他抗争，必要时也将为他献出生命。他是我们的希望与荣耀，也是这个冷漠世界中我们唯一的喜悦。\n\n-- 审判者\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b41fa3cb9f3c70ba179f27396120856cba0f38fbaf49d94b703d176b4d106123","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"68e86ad6d74c9eadd710e9700ca7964b821bfe70fea5c538dd5276a9677005ff","logical_entry_identity":"83f61851cbecf71fd12af564e12658bab11bd6a3033430b106559c13ed01dd50","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Precise Strikes","source_tag":"talent name","target":"精准打击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7601f9c87fbb4493200bfe6de7cef5c7cb28500d7aebb984027f91ed978262b0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"68eab406b1905bca14b06346d941453e9081f50f699b6edd902f796485eab8ec","logical_entry_identity":"5f9428221df71903fcd5df43a3bc7582a52fba211d47b51eb88a4886855cfa37","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This large snake hisses at you, angry at being disturbed.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这条大蛇向你发出嘶嘶声，对被打扰感到愤怒。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"20e6c04e9b5f4c4faf026c922b2bf2182dffe3578f0c7fac6df847850ffc50aa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"68eca0ed71b8c3f544df39f37bdb9951e5fd16a83844ad02b9518d5b2b55f552","logical_entry_identity":"3257ffc792664829c45145b59bc111e203f35df53421e2e0cb39047d5c423325","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The blindside fizzles!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"闪电突袭失败了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"728bdaaac6d5d8972f3c2b0af6471f0fc28402e82f28e79e9198bddb8a0d4f8c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"68f1790e39fe697469091db618f13e7036163d6d167f2c5a0f1c071168cb2432","logical_entry_identity":"ed327ad2ce3971886d6e36955f11a7de673ffdd6b405c9033da8b9006e436630","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"slave combatant","source_tag":"entity name","target":"奴隶斗士"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578